{
  "id": "ink-painting",
  "abi": "8",
  "name": "水墨写意",
  "keywords": [
    "水墨",
    "国风",
    "宣纸",
    "毛笔",
    "写意",
    "留白",
    "墨线"
  ],
  "when": "需要一笔浓淡分明的墨线慢慢长出来、大片留白让观众自己补完画面时",
  "blocks": [
    "scene.code"
  ],
  "style": {
    "fonts": {
      "display": "sans-900",
      "body": "sans-400",
      "num": "latin-700",
      "caption": "sans-900"
    },
    "colors": {
      "bg": "#101010",
      "ink": "#F2F2F2",
      "muted": "#8A8A8A",
      "accent": "#FFFFFF",
      "line": "#2E2E2E"
    },
    "backgrounds": {
      "paper": "#101010"
    }
  },
  "rules": {
    "safeMargin": 0.09,
    "scale": {
      "title": 1,
      "label": 0.75,
      "note": 0.55
    },
    "stroke": [
      3,
      12
    ],
    "pen": {
      "mode": "fixed",
      "value": "inkbrush"
    },
    "board": {
      "mode": "fixed",
      "value": "wash"
    },
    "forbid": [
      "把画面内容写成 block 的题材枚举参数（例如用 scene 选项挑画哪一幅）",
      "在同一帧叠两种纸：宣纸只能来自 TT.board.wash，不许再铺一层底色",
      "用规则几何图形或纯色色块代替墨线；浓淡必须靠笔锋提按与叠笔产生",
      "墨迹或文字越出 safeMargin；印章压到主体墨线",
      "把整段旁白原样抄进 code；code 只写画与题款"
    ]
  },
  "captions": {
    "style": "plain",
    "font": "caption",
    "baseSize": 46,
    "lineHeight": 1.22,
    "top": 0.78,
    "at": "bottom",
    "size": 0.8,
    "maxWidth": 0.5
  },
  "audio": {
    "mood": "cut",
    "volume": 0.1,
    "fadeIn": 0.8,
    "fadeOut": 1.6,
    "duck": {
      "level": 0.045,
      "edge": 0.12
    }
  },
  "verify": [
    {
      "at": 0.15,
      "assert": "ink.insideSafe",
      "args": {
        "margin": 0.09
      }
    },
    {
      "at": 0.9,
      "assert": "element.count.gte",
      "args": {
        "n": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "at": 0.9,
      "assert": "caption.noOverlapSubject",
      "args": {}
    }
  ]
}
